  "historical_output_text": " The story should contain at Least four different literary themes and use at Least 4 different types or styles in a dialogue.\nIt had been six years since that day I last visited our family park and it felt the time has healed everything.\nI took the walk to the place and remembered how the leaves would rustled as we played. But this day felt somehow different, and that is the first theme of this narration- Change.\n\n“Why is everything different, why is there nothing familiar? It feels wrong to see all these new buildings and people walking around”- my friend asked while I was on the way.\nI took the path, I knew I needed it. And when it was just about a 1 mile I reached to the end. But this park looked somehow not mine, it wasn‘ t my memory that brought me this way. And then",
